{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122623","id":4320005803,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAX4Oqw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122623.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122623","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122623/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122623/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122623/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/92a52095ea7c175a8bd5522542aea596bd8a421d","number":122623,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add FontVariation unit tests","user":{"login":"vhsgreed","id":77639664,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NjM5NjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77639664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed","html_url":"https://github.com/vhsgreed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhsgreed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds unit tests for `FontVariation`, one of the remaining open slots on the unit test tracker (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/43440).\n\n## What's covered\n\nTwo test cases in `tests/scene/test_font_variation.cpp`:\n\n1. **Variation settings roundtrip** — set/get roundtrips for `variation_opentype`, `variation_embolden`, `variation_transform`, and `variation_face_index`, plus reset-to-default checks. No font loading required.\n2. **Base font delegation** — with a `FontFile` loaded from the existing `thirdparty/fonts/Inter_Regular.woff2` test asset, verifies that a `FontVariation` with no variation applied reports the base font's name/style/weight and identical metrics (`get_height`, `get_ascent`, `get_descent`, `get_string_size`). Guarded by `#ifdef MODULE_FREETYPE_ENABLED`, same as `test_fontfile.cpp`.\n\nNo new assets or build-system changes: `tests/SCsub` auto-globs `test_*.cpp`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Every API used was cross-checked against `scene/resources/font.h` / `font.cpp` on master (e.g. `FontVariation::_get_rid()` delegates to `base_font->find_variation(...)`, so unvaried metrics match the base font).\n- Not compiled locally (no Godot build environment available); the engine test suite runs on CI for this PR.\n\n> [!INFO] *AI disclosure*: This contribution was prepared with AI assistance on behalf of karlsune, who reviewed the change and the referenced API surface.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-20T05:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T08:30:09Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T08:30:03Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"89d00d6f19313fc71e5fa607f42